### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/

### CREATE a course
POST http://localhost:8080/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseName": "Programming Languages",
  "courseCode": "CS301",
  "hoursPerWeek": 6,
  "creditUnits": 3,
  "hoursCompleted": 0
}

### READ all courses
GET http://localhost:8080/courses

### READ one course (replace {id} with a real id from the create response)
GET http://localhost:8080/courses/{id}

### UPDATE a course (log hours completed)
PUT http://localhost:8080/courses/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{id}",
  "courseName": "Programming Languages",
  "courseCode": "CS301",
  "hoursPerWeek": 6,
  "creditUnits": 3,
  "hoursCompleted": 4.5
}

### DELETE a course
DELETE http://localhost:8080/courses/{id}

### CREATE an assignment for a course
POST http://localhost:8080/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{id}",
  "title": "Week 3 - Kotlin CRUD Lab",
  "weekNumber": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-09-26",
  "submitted": false,
  "hoursSpent": 0
}

### READ all assignments for a course
GET http://localhost:8080/assignments/course/{id}

### UPDATE an assignment (mark submitted on time)
PUT http://localhost:8080/assignments/{assignmentId}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{assignmentId}",
  "courseId": "{id}",
  "title": "Week 3 - Kotlin CRUD Lab",
  "weekNumber": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-09-26",
  "submitted": true,
  "submittedOnTime": true,
  "hoursSpent": 3.5
}

### View progress summary for a course
GET http://localhost:8080/courses/{id}/progress

### DELETE an assignment
DELETE http://localhost:8080/assignments/{assignmentId}
